; The construction layer (P8): build_providers / build_extractor /
; build_fetch_stack / build_app, ported from [src/seekwright/factory.py] and
; kept out of the server's startup path so [--check] can diagnose a deployment
; without building the MCP server. It is its own library —
; [seekwright.factory], wrapped as [Seekwright_factory] — for the same reason
; [lib/providers/] is one: the adapters depend on [seekwright], so a factory
; inside that library could not name them without closing a cycle
; (plans/seekwright-ocaml-port.md, the P4 note).
(library
 (name seekwright_factory)
 (public_name seekwright.factory)
 (libraries
  seekwright
  seekwright.providers
  seekwright.fetch
  seekwright.fetch.stdlib
  mcp-caps
  eio
  uri
  yojson))
